# Reply format

Reply with one JSON value only: no prose before or after it and no code fences. It must match this JSON Schema:
{"type":"object","properties":{"picks":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"object","properties":{"n":{"type":"integer"},"score":{"type":"integer"}},"required":["n","score"],"additionalProperties":false}}},"required":["picks"],"additionalProperties":false}
